# 📖 Overview

The **Vitrum Glass Production Planning System** is an enterprise-grade manufacturing application developed specifically for the glass manufacturing industry.

The platform helps production planners create, manage, and monitor manufacturing schedules while optimizing machine capacity, reducing downtime, and ensuring efficient production planning across multiple production lines.

The application provides an intuitive dashboard for production planning, bottle master management, machine allocation, job scheduling, packing configuration, and real-time production tracking.

---

